  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Qué es esta prueba",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Comando:** `./scripts/caos/fallo4-oomkilled.sh`  \n**Caso del documento:** Punto 11 · Fallo 4 (Recursos / OOMKilled).\n\n**Qué deberías ver:** la **memoria** de Monetización sube en rampa hasta el 100 % del límite (256 Mi) y cae; **OOMKilled** pasa a 1 y **Reinicios** sube; mientras el contenedor está caído, los mensajes **visibles** (esperando) en la cola suben y se drenan al volver.\n\n**Criterio de éxito:** OOMKilled = 1, el contenedor vuelve solo, la cola vuelve a 0, DLQ = 0 e integridad OK.\n\nAntes de empezar: `./scripts/reiniciar-entorno.sh`. No interrumpas el script en las esperas.  \n**En vivo, a mano:** `kubectl exec -n aws-local deploy/servicio-monetizacion -- python -c` con una fuga de 4 MiB/s (ver docs/guia-de-pruebas.md). En la app: el check-out funciona y el cobro espera en la cola."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Contenedores terminados por OOMKilled",
      "description": "Motivo de la última terminación según kube-state-metrics.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"aws-local\", reason=\"OOMKilled\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "OOMKilled",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Reinicios de Monetización",
      "description": "Sube cada vez que el contenedor muere y Kubernetes lo reinicia en el mismo Pod.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"aws-local\", container=\"monetizacion\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "reinicios",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria · % del límite en el tiempo",
      "description": "La rampa hacia el 100 % y la caída al morir el contenedor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (container) (100 * sum by (namespace, pod, container) ((container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"aws-local\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\", container=~\"monetizacion\"} and on (id) (container_start_time_seconds{namespace=\"aws-local\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\", container=~\"monetizacion\"} == on (namespace, pod, container) group_left () max by (namespace, pod, container) (container_start_time_seconds{namespace=\"aws-local\", container!=\"\", container!=\"POD\", container=~\"monetizacion\"})))) / on (namespace, pod, container) sum by (namespace, pod, container) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"aws-local\", resource=\"memory\", container=~\"monetizacion\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line+area"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 5
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "id": 4,
      "gridPos": {
